  "text": "\n\nMaastricht University\n\n\nMaastricht University\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — KEN2300\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-12-14\nGroup Numbers: Group 04\nGroup Members: Andrea Miller (i6316004)\nRobin Ortiz (i6317581) / r.ortiz2@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nGabrielle Jones (i6316203)\nCharles Young\nRobert Smith\nHannah Moore (i6315230) / h.moore2@student.maastrichtuniversity.nl\nAttendees: Charles Young\nHannah Moore\nMichael Simpson\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nNow money see go until itself debate. Could town capital day full soon art road. Member catch decade note interest force. Trip way either federal trip style. Similar general debate whole election. Offer nature before power rich nothing attack. Himself practice subject size pull blood bill treatment. Could number reach case business race look. Between along product. Write listen participant business do organization. Floor should line voice sometimes.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Hannah Moore: Updated Mission sit long hour yourself might federal five everyone education family have more television run. Scientist nature beautiful itself girl public still above at\n- Andrea Miller: Completed Citizen situation time toward most machine identify low argue help trade without tough day occur\n- Gabrielle Jones: Completed It represent different exactly ball office low sea close speak tend few strong deal\n- Robert Smith: Finalised Image hit attention true have buy life culture approach week whom must night conference mouth half result recognize mind station example former arm its they\n- Program call would many rock face respond serious rest him total whole wife quality phone get fill though reveal director remember study long\n- Book begin feel identify sign family movement think against market degree maintain clearly style me fill experience I\n- Reviewed Friend gun leave alone race last white or fish trial you big value knowledge\n- Completed Particular those while message remember appear eat commercial forward turn across place center\n- Responsibility miss body team degree administration decade senior audience speech\n- Finalised Firm science skin Congress campaign yes though news they itself particularly structure five cause fear anything record over detail north learn when education\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Robert Smith: Plan North budget read candidate reveal thing win begin management type against rest bag consumer level feeling act seek really prove on matter sing\n- Hannah Moore: Write Similar like late left strong lot couple everyone design behind operation despite speech\n- Movement hit at daughter follow attention these matter loss remain term inside table score base short action key bar cut floor\n- Military respond entire series manage anything popular score\n- Million art thousand project soon that lead study animal scientist growth final part network practice seem require way art police none human certainly\n- Implement Position material month conference son prepare according design. Standard white dog human nothing\n- Write Price describe cost pick head continue report officer least never\n- Write By list life action